        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9038P, Rome Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rome Appliance Handle is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from a wide array of modern finishes. This Rome Appliance Pull comes packaged with the hardware needed to install it on a standard appliance panel like those found on Sub-Zero Refrigerators; but it can also be installed on other kitchen appliances. The modern round shape is easy to clean and looks sleek and stylish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9038P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/rome-cabinet-pull-omnia-9038\"><b> Rome Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima AP-9038P Rome Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9038P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9038P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
